dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.text.mutations
version 1
schema s.stdio.semio.text
start body
framing record

# Real `SemioTextMutation` op frame: `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag u8`, then the kind's `key=value ...` text arguments.
# Each record is one mutation kind at its wire tag. This file is the only source of those tags: the codec
# derives every tag from these records (`dsl::protocol_record`), and decodes a tag to its record's kind.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
record insert-run tag=0
field payload bytes
record remove-run tag=1
field payload bytes
record edit-run tag=2
field payload bytes
record change-run-language tag=3
field payload bytes
record reorder-runs tag=4
field payload bytes
record add-mark tag=5
field payload bytes
record remove-mark tag=6
field payload bytes
